sequenceDiagram
    participant Planner
    participant Builder
    participant Tester
    Note left of Planner: On the left
    Note right of Builder: On the right
    Note over Tester: Over one participant
    Planner->>Builder: Plan
    Note over Planner,Builder: Spanning two participants
    Note over Builder,Tester: A longer note that spans two participants and needs more room than the others
    Builder->>Tester: Build
    Note over Tester,Planner: Reversed pair
    note right of Tester: Last note
